[B][FONT=Verdana][SIZE=6][COLOR=#0059b3]Support[/COLOR][/SIZE][/FONT][/B]

[QUOTE][CENTER][SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#ff8000]Got a question, bug or idea? We'd love to help - just not in the reviews.[/COLOR][/B]
A review only allows a single reply, so there is no real conversation possible. Please check the [URL='https://github.com/CorneliusMa/SilkSpawners_v2/blob/master/docs/FAQ.md'][B]FAQ[/B][/URL] and otherwise [URL='https://github.com/CorneliusMa/SilkSpawners_v2/issues'][B]open a GitHub issue[/B][/URL], that's where we reply fastest. Spigot discussion and chat are only checked occasionally.
Running [B]/silkspawners dump[/B] creates a diagnostic report - plugin, server and Java versions, the installed plugins and your configuration - on [URL='https://pastes.dev']pastes.dev[/URL] and replies with a link to attach to the issue.[/SIZE][/CENTER][/QUOTE]
